41
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:09,860
and its subfunctions.

42
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:12,920
So when multiple execution flows are running at the same time,

43
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:16,940
that's actually the simplest form of multitasking.

44
00:02:16,940 --> 00:02:21,780
Of course, this requires multiple cores executing simultaneously.

45
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:23,400
If there are two cores, you have two tasks

46
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,960
