00:02:48,820 --> 00:02:51,560
That is, right now we only have one core.

58
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,520
By the way, let me mention this,

59
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:56,340
in the exercises,

60
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:57,220
you should have also seen

